{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49856","headline":"芳草渡 · 冯延巳","name":"芳草渡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梧桐落，蓼花秋。\n烟初冷，雨才收。\n萧条风物正堪愁，人去後，多少恨，在心头。\n燕鸿远，羌笛怨，渺渺澄波一片。\n山如黛，月如钩。\n笙歌散，梦魂断，倚高楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}